              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "At the end of three nail-biting rounds, Dr Hina Qazi emerged victorious. We would especially like to thank Dr. Abdul Sami Memon, Dr. M. Bilal Malik and Dr. Benish Aslam for their incredible support in planning and conducting the event. We look forward to conducting many more tournaments for post graduate trainees soon! ",
