    "show_share": true,
    "description": "CIME Pakistan in collaboration with the Section of Ophthalmology organised the country's first-ever EyeSurg Tournament for ophthalmology residents and medical officers. This tournament was held as part of the PGME silver jubilee celebration. Participants performed a variety of procedures related to anterior chamber surgery on CIME's EyeSi simulator - the first of its kind in Pakistan.",
